,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.190778106,"data":"21:53:51   661d44378995a193 narrator neutral | Behold! A legend... brought low by ONE dumpling.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.191683923,"data":"21:53:51   3c6c7ac27e4f8640 boy neutral | Welcome to The Dumpling Boy! Today's mystery: how does hot soup get in\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.192755137,"data":"21:53:51   42afef6d44fabf36 uncle neutral | Co-host!\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.193608579,"data":"21:53:51   4fd3a7c3c903cf73 boy neutral | He's the warning label. Let's rewind.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.194653684,"data":"21:53:51   aa88f785663c6bdc boy neutral | The Silk Road? Not one road. A web, by land and sea.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.195474137,"data":"21:53:51   aa30f5a61974dc5a boy neutral | Over a thousand years ago, Qinglong port, near Shanghai, shipped potte\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.196530303,"data":"21:53:51   2956e1b17d220145 boy neutral | Dad's first page: be patient. The soup is the secret.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.197409255,"data":"21:53:51   9d410969e171ae40 boy neutral | Patient.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.198283022,"data":"21:53:51   8b127ba1ffea0f34 boy neutral | Nanxiang. An old canal town, now part of Shanghai.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.199599159,"data":"21:53:51   2b57f87227e38018 boy neutral | Two pagodas, about a thousand years old. The temple burned in 1766. Th\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.200254202,"data":"21:53:51   bcbe78da041f9acb uncle neutral | Veterans.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.201279257,"data":"21:53:51   3fc3fdac78979095 boy neutral | They're pagodas.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.202201816,"data":"21:53:51   bb6997d9fee62197 narrator neutral | Behold! The stall... of DESTINY.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.203253994,"data":"21:53:51   14be63875120443f boy neutral | It's a stall.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.204061318,"data":"21:53:51   0599b20d50aeffda narrator neutral | Of DESTINY.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.20508378,"data":"21:53:51   d036dc83d3ca178d boy neutral | How do you get soup inside?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.205983438,"data":"21:53:51   fa7b1c68c5044823 grandma neutral | Everyone asks. First, you make it solid.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.206879161,"data":"21:53:51   600457e9f4059919 grandma neutral | Pork skin, boiled for hours. Chilled, it sets. Chopped into the meat.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.207893404,"data":"21:53:51   377bd6dc346fe346 boy neutral | Wait. The soup goes in SOLID?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.208787447,"data":"21:53:51   98b9639bc07ee268 uncle neutral | Steam melts it back into soup.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.210024011,"data":"21:53:51   bdaa9a01ff31e8aa uncle neutral | Never boil them. The skin bursts. Lunch is my field.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.210904496,"data":"21:53:51   078a0f8da32861af narrator neutral | The training arc begins!\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.211800618,"data":"21:53:51   8ac1a4767295561c uncle neutral | Behold.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.21285033,"data":"21:53:51   87c706bc295384a8 grandma neutral | That's a sock.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.213784148,"data":"21:53:51   2577a3179402347d boy neutral | A very ambitious sock.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.21456437,"data":"21:53:51   6b1711176fdb72df grandma neutral | Slowly.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.215535758,"data":"21:53:51   8747d6caa38ddfec uncle neutral | For dumpling research!\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.216397336,"data":"21:53:51   c5b75656ba70a120 boy neutral | Rule one of soup dumplings: don't...\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.217406389,"data":"21:53:51   8ec1e0764c9ec7a0 narrator neutral | But the dumpling... had a secret.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.218203738,"data":"21:53:51   ee6e8143f7c02c7a boy neutral | ...do that.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.219224954,"data":"21:53:51   fcdf455d184b058b grandma neutral | Okay, watch. Lift it by the top knot. Onto a spoon.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.220035128,"data":"21:53:51   9d685bbc7a14b72d grandma neutral | Tiny hole. Let the steam out. Then wait.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.220979653,"data":"21:53:51   d35d81f9a3e220af uncle neutral | Be cool. Be cool.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.22195622,"data":"21:53:51   898371b00261705c grandma neutral | Soup first. It's hot! Then the dumpling, with black vinegar and ginger\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.22281814,"data":"21:53:51   2a8233be8ad7f8e4 uncle neutral | Good soup can't be rushed. Someone waited hours for this.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.2238581,"data":"21:53:51   555f5ff3ce0193d2 uncle neutral | For dumpling research.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.224704205,"data":"21:53:51   e0525ab072619ffd uncle neutral | Are there more?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.225403231,"data":"21:53:51   7e9ce1d5a5146fe4 grandma neutral | Five.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.226125407,"data":"21:53:51   b2726fb4149734a9 narrator neutral | LEGEND SAYS!\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.227037085,"data":"21:53:51   5f761df999d37a0a narrator neutral | Around the year 1871, in Nanxiang, a shopkeeper sold ONE enormous meat\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.227807567,"data":"21:53:51   d0edf3eaf9f2769d narrator neutral | Nobody cared. So he made it smaller... and hid soup inside, set as jel\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.228521014,"data":"21:53:51   a8d72bb92bbef2aa narrator neutral | It became famous... by SHRINKING!\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.229181594,"data":"21:53:51   506ccf1520372245 boy neutral | Can we skip the dramatic voice?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.229997568,"data":"21:53:51   102107e3b4afe05f narrator neutral | No.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.23073892,"data":"21:53:51   a116f77e5ae885b1 boy neutral | Legend. That's historian for 'please don't quote me.'\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.231461878,"data":"21:53:51   1a015c2edd51bb5c grandma neutral | That hat... A man sat on that stool. He burned his tongue, too.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.232119159,"data":"21:53:51   9cc814515ad2b4de boy neutral | ...My dad?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.232857934,"data":"21:53:51   e36cfa9dbf8d5534 boy neutral | Dad wrote: rush it, get burned. Be patient, get the best part.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.233620547,"data":"21:53:51   0c5b8cf3d5eb2795 uncle neutral | FOR DUMPLING RESEARCH!\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.234312121,"data":"21:53:51   736f5abd764ae8da boy neutral | He's already packed.\n"}
